{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18699","headline":"巽公院五咏 芙蓉亭 · 柳宗元","name":"巽公院五咏 芙蓉亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新亭俯朱槛，嘉木开芙蓉。\n清香晨风远，溽彩寒露浓。\n潇洒出人世，低昂多异容。\n尝闻色空喻，造物谁爲工。\n留连秋月晏，迢递来山钟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18699.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18699","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}